description: Frontend Architecture and shadcn/ui integration rules
globs: ["src/**/*.tsx", "src/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: true
---

# Enterprise Frontend Architecture Rules

## 1. Design System (shadcn/ui + Tailwind)
- ALWAYS check and import UI components from `@/components/ui/*` (e.g. Button, Card, Table, Dialog, Badge, Input, Label, Tabs, Toast, Sidebar).
- NEVER re-implement custom HTML inputs, tables, or buttons if a shadcn component exists.
- Style using Tailwind CSS utility classes with dark theme accents (`bg-zinc-950`, `border-zinc-800`, `text-zinc-100`, `text-emerald-400`).
- Always use the `cn()` helper from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes.

## 2. Backend Contract & API Synchronization
- Base Gateway URL: `http://localhost:8080/api/v1`
- Always use the centralized Axios client from `@/api/client` (which injects the JWT Bearer token).
- Strictly adhere to data types defined in `@/types/api.ts`.
- Every form submission must handle:
  - Loading state (`disabled` button + spinner).
  - Success notifications (HTTP 200/201).
  - Conflict/Validation error alerts (HTTP 409 Conflict, 400 Bad Request).